<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>PreferenceSpecifiers</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>手机当手柄（没有连外接手柄时）</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>陀螺仪：倾斜手机当作 Switch 掌机的体感（如斯普拉遁的倾斜瞄准），只在游戏需要体感时开传感器。震动：游戏的手柄震动改由手机马达输出。连上外接手柄后自动改用手柄。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>手机陀螺仪</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2APhoneGyro</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <true/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>手机震动</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2APhoneHaptics</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <true/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>Switch 模式（改完要重开游戏）</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>主机模式对应 Switch 连接底座时的模式，关闭时使用掌机模式。实际分辨率和画质由游戏决定；与兼容 / 高性能运行模式分别设置。下次启动生效。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>主机模式</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2ADockedMode</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <false/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>画面（改完要重开游戏）</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>相对于游戏当前渲染尺寸缩放，保留现有宽屏。降低倍率可减轻图形负载；提高倍率可改善清晰度，也会增加耗电和内存占用。部分纹理仍按游戏原始尺寸处理。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSMultiValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>渲染分辨率倍率</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2AResolutionScale</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>1</string>
            <key>Titles</key>
            <array><string>0.5×</string><string>0.75×</string><string>1×（原生）</string><string>1.5×</string><string>2×</string></array>
            <key>Values</key>
            <array><string>0.5</string><string>0.75</string><string>1</string><string>1.5</string><string>2</string></array>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>对最终游戏画面减少锯齿，也可能使文字和细节变柔和。关闭后仍保留游戏自带的抗锯齿。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSMultiValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>抗锯齿</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2AAntiAliasing</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>None</string>
            <key>Titles</key>
            <array><string>关闭</string><string>SMAA 中</string><string>SMAA 高</string></array>
            <key>Values</key>
            <array><string>None</string><string>SmaaMedium</string><string>SmaaHigh</string></array>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>用于将游戏画面缩放到屏幕，不改变内部渲染分辨率。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSMultiValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>画面缩放滤镜</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2AScalingFilter</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>Bilinear</string>
            <key>Titles</key>
            <array><string>双线性（平滑）</string><string>最近邻（像素清晰）</string></array>
            <key>Values</key>
            <array><string>Bilinear</string><string>Nearest</string></array>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>设置游戏画面的帧率上限，不会解除游戏自身的帧率锁。实际帧率还取决于游戏表现和屏幕刷新率。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSMultiValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>帧率上限</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2AFrameRateLimit</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>0</string>
            <key>Titles</key>
            <array><string>30 帧/秒</string><string>60 帧/秒</string><string>120 帧/秒</string><string>不限</string></array>
            <key>Values</key>
            <array><string>30</string><string>60</string><string>120</string><string>0</string></array>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>手柄</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>开启后可在游戏中连接 Switch 2 Pro 手柄，使用按键、双频震动和体感。连接时需长按手柄顶部 SYNC 键。此设置仅对当前 App 生效。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>启用 Switch 2 Pro 手柄适配</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2ANS2ProAdapterEnabled</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <false/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>存档</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>先在游戏内保存，再关闭并重新打开 App。存档管理会在游戏启动前打开，可导出备份或导入 Mac 的 .s2asave 文件。恢复前会保留原存档。开始游戏后开关自动关闭。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>下次打开时管理存档</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2ASaveManageOnOpen</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <false/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>诊断</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>打开这个开关后切回游戏，S2Arm 会把最近几次运行的日志打成诊断包，弹出分享面板（隔空投送、存到文件、微信）。诊断包不含存档、密钥和游戏文件。导出后开关会自动关上。游戏中四指同时长按屏幕 1.5 秒也能导出。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>打开 App 时导出诊断包</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2ADiagExportOnOpen</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <false/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>开发</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>S2Arm 诊断浮层显示目标帧率、慢帧比例、图形路径、首遇编译、音频和包号。Metal HUD 显示帧率、GPU 时间和帧间隔曲线，仅供手动观察；开启时截图、存帧、自动玩家和满屏判据不可用。设置在下次启动 App 时生效。Metal HUD 用于自行构建并安装到开发设备的 App。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>S2Arm 诊断浮层</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2ADevHUD</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <false/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSToggleSwitchSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>Metal HUD</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>MetalHUDForceEnabled</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <false/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSGroupSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>关于本包（只读）</string>
            <key>FooterText</key>
            <string>出包时就定下来了，改不了：这一包是直连还是只走通用兜底、直连库是哪一版、什么时候出的包。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSTitleValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>画面模式</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2AGraphicsModeText</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>未知（打开一次游戏后显示）</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSTitleValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>直连库版本</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2ADirectLibVersionText</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>未知（打开一次游戏后显示）</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSTitleValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>出包时间（UTC）</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2APackTimeText</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>未知（打开一次游戏后显示）</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>Type</key>
            <string>PSTitleValueSpecifier</string>
            <key>Title</key>
            <string>包号</string>
            <key>Key</key>
            <string>S2ABuildIDText</string>
            <key>DefaultValue</key>
            <string>未知（打开一次游戏后显示）</string>
        </dict>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
